WEBVTT

00:02.900 --> 00:07.070
<b>My Instant Death Ability is Overpowered</b>

00:05.940 --> 00:09.410
<b>A single blow that stabs your heart</b>

00:09.410 --> 00:12.580
<b>No arguments, listen you fools</b>

00:12.580 --> 00:16.120
<b>A striking blow of my compelling Bars</b>

00:16.120 --> 00:19.420
<b>Without saying a word, you start to dance</b>

00:19.420 --> 00:22.880
<b>My song gets you hooked Oh...</b>

00:22.880 --> 00:26.300
<b>People in earshot will dance Oh...</b>

00:26.300 --> 00:29.760
<b>Now close your eyes Oh...</b>

00:29.760 --> 00:33.300
<b>No one can escape My Killer Bars</b>

00:34.350 --> 00:37.220
<b>Get out of my way, I'm coming through</b>

00:37.220 --> 00:40.560
<b>I've got this famous one verse
for 10 years now</b>

00:40.560 --> 00:42.400
<b>My existence is a cheat, a criminal</b>

00:42.400 --> 00:44.270
<b>One word and all hits critical</b>

00:44.270 --> 00:45.780
<b>Everyone wants this power</b>

00:45.780 --> 00:47.740
<b>So every time I threat like this</b>

00:47.740 --> 00:50.700
<b>"Those who aren't prepared, leave."</b>

00:50.700 --> 00:54.240
<b>The weaker goes to the pot,
this world is a feast</b>

00:54.240 --> 00:57.790
<b>This heaven-gift makes me unprecedent</b>

00:57.790 --> 01:00.210
<b>If you feel unfair, then blame the God</b>

01:00.210 --> 01:03.500
<b>A single blow that stabs your heart</b>

01:03.500 --> 01:06.800
<b>No arguments, listen you fools</b>

01:06.800 --> 01:10.220
<b>A striking blow of my compelling Bars</b>

01:10.220 --> 01:13.470
<b>Without saying a word, you start to dance</b>

01:13.470 --> 01:16.850
<b>My song gets you hooked Oh...</b>

01:16.850 --> 01:20.270
<b>People in earshot will dance Oh...</b>

01:20.270 --> 01:23.770
<b>Now close your eyes Oh...</b>

01:23.770 --> 01:27.650
<b>No one can escape My Killer Bars</b>

01:29.990 --> 01:33.450
<b>My Guardian Spirit is the Strongest, This Other World Doesn't Stand a Chance!</b>

01:34.060 --> 01:36.280
<b>We're finally here.</b>

01:36.610 --> 01:38.720
<b>We've reached the town, Takatou!</b>

01:41.030 --> 01:44.140
<b>Hey, they're already closing the gate.</b>

01:44.140 --> 01:47.650
<b>Isn't it natural that
they're closing in the evening?</b>

01:47.650 --> 01:49.630
<b>Let's hurry, then!</b>

01:50.090 --> 01:52.260
<b>Excuse me!</b>

01:54.680 --> 01:55.950
<b>Huh?</b>

02:01.570 --> 02:04.940
<b>A separate group from those
who came at noon?</b>

02:04.940 --> 02:09.150
<b>What a pain.
How could this happen?</b>

02:09.150 --> 02:13.350
<b>I'm glad there's someone
who understands.</b>

02:13.350 --> 02:17.490
<b>We got separated from those guys
and tried to catch up to them.</b>

02:18.330 --> 02:21.170
<b>We'd normally charge you a toll,</b>

02:21.170 --> 02:24.460
<b>but we've been told not to get in
the way of the sage candidates.</b>

02:24.840 --> 02:27.630
<b>They said something about
going to the Capital.</b>

02:27.630 --> 02:29.630
<b>How do we get there from here?</b>

02:29.630 --> 02:33.800
<b>We've been told not to get in your way,
but we weren't told we must help you.</b>

02:34.070 --> 02:35.240
<b>Thanks, I guess.</b>

02:38.360 --> 02:40.210
<b>Oh, right.</b>

02:40.210 --> 02:44.440
<b>I don't mind if the girl stays
at my mansion tonight.</b>

02:45.290 --> 02:47.110
<b>No, thank you!</b>

02:53.930 --> 02:55.530
<b>What was that suddenly?</b>

02:55.780 --> 02:59.660
<b>I was afraid you might kill him.</b>

02:59.660 --> 03:03.200
<b>What am I to you?
A serial killer?</b>

03:03.200 --> 03:06.630
<b>The part of you that hasn't noticed it
is the one that makes me amazed.</b>

03:07.540 --> 03:11.130
<b>Look! This town really feels
like a fantasy.</b>

03:11.130 --> 03:14.590
<b>There are even people that
look like beast folk!</b>

03:14.590 --> 03:17.800
<b>Are myouw two sage candidates?</b>

03:19.050 --> 03:22.070
<b>It seems this is your first time here.</b>

03:22.070 --> 03:24.770
<b>Are myouw in trouble or something?</b>

03:25.450 --> 03:27.230
<b>Cat ears!</b>

03:27.230 --> 03:28.230
<b>What do you want?</b>

03:28.230 --> 03:32.690
<b>Is there anything I can help you with?
Of course it's purree!</b>

03:33.030 --> 03:34.410
<b>Help?</b>

03:34.410 --> 03:36.450
<b>Is there any merit for you?</b>

03:36.450 --> 03:40.270
<b>I want to get along meowith
the boys of sage candidates.</b>

03:40.270 --> 03:43.410
<b>They have a good future
and are easy to seduce.</b>

03:43.710 --> 03:45.790
<b>This person is so blunt.</b>

03:45.790 --> 03:50.810
<b>Of course, I don't plan to seduce
somewone who has a girlfriend.</b>

03:50.810 --> 03:56.260
<b>I believe the secret to success is to develop
a steady purriendship with them.</b>

03:56.260 --> 03:58.140
<b>I'm not his girlfriend.</b>

03:58.450 --> 03:59.460
<b>What do you think?</b>

03:59.460 --> 04:03.520
<b>To be honest, I want to look around
the town before it gets dark.</b>

04:03.520 --> 04:05.220
<b>Then, let's ask for her help.</b>

04:05.660 --> 04:08.670
<b>My name is Mireiyu.
Nice to meet myouw!</b>

04:10.570 --> 04:12.040
<b>Phew!</b>

04:12.370 --> 04:14.890
<b>In the end, I bought clothes too.</b>

04:14.890 --> 04:17.410
<b>I'd never be able to wear something
like this normally.</b>

04:20.490 --> 04:24.240
<b>And I figured that we'd end up like this.</b>

04:24.240 --> 04:28.710
<b>Okay, I'm sorry!
I followed her since she looked kind!</b>

04:29.030 --> 04:31.670
<b>You seem awfully relaxed.</b>

04:31.670 --> 04:33.470
<b>You want money?</b>

04:33.470 --> 04:36.310
<b>Money is a must,</b>

04:36.310 --> 04:40.380
<b>but our true objectives are
talentless sage candidates.</b>

04:40.800 --> 04:43.780
<b>Those Gift possessers often
go crazy in this town.</b>

04:43.780 --> 04:46.350
<b>We hate them,
but we can't do anything to them.</b>

04:46.350 --> 04:51.310
<b>However, people like you make great
stress relief and fetch a high price.</b>

04:51.750 --> 04:53.820
<b>I get your objectives now.</b>

04:53.820 --> 04:57.530
<b>In that case, I have to kill you.
Is that okay?</b>

04:57.530 --> 04:59.280
<b>Huh?</b>

04:59.280 --> 05:04.320
<b>Don't worry, we won't kill you.</b>

05:04.320 --> 05:08.450
<b>Though you'll probably wish to die.</b>

05:08.450 --> 05:12.650
<b>Mireiyu, Takatou may look like this,
but he is strong!</b>

05:12.650 --> 05:14.670
<b>You guys have no chance against him!</b>

05:14.670 --> 05:18.630
<b>Meowhat? A bluff like that won't work.</b>

05:18.630 --> 05:25.350
<b>Two weaklings without Sage's Gift can't
do anything no matter how hard you try.</b>

05:25.350 --> 05:28.270
<b>First, everyone behind us, die.</b>

05:31.560 --> 05:35.020
<b>What did you...</b>

05:36.480 --> 05:38.130
<b>You, half die.</b>

05:42.360 --> 05:44.780
<b>I guess even half is too much.</b>

05:44.780 --> 05:46.230
<b>Right ankle.</b>

05:47.990 --> 05:49.910
<b>Oops, I messed up.</b>

05:49.910 --> 05:51.110
<b>Left arm.</b>

05:53.930 --> 05:56.730
<b>Takatou, you...</b>

05:57.360 --> 06:00.300
<b>I tried to go easy on them.</b>

06:00.990 --> 06:02.000
<b>Eyeballs.</b>

06:05.640 --> 06:08.870
<b>My eyes! My eyes! My eyes!</b>

06:08.870 --> 06:10.130
<b>Damn you!</b>

06:10.890 --> 06:13.350
<b>What are myouw exactly?</b>

06:13.690 --> 06:14.820
<b>Who knows?</b>

06:15.580 --> 06:18.530
<b>Killing individual parts is not efficient.</b>

06:19.110 --> 06:21.620
<b>Also, I don't like the feeling of
as if I'm torturing them on purpose.</b>

06:22.510 --> 06:23.920
<b>Please spare me!</b>

06:23.920 --> 06:28.780
<b>My hungry little brothers are
waiting for me to come home!</b>

06:28.780 --> 06:32.700
<b>But that doesn't mean
robbing and selling people are okay.</b>

06:33.000 --> 06:35.500
<b>Aren't you talentless?</b>

06:37.290 --> 06:38.290
<b>Die.</b>

06:43.050 --> 06:44.780
<b>It didn't work!</b>

06:45.150 --> 06:46.810
<b>Now's my chance!</b>

06:47.640 --> 06:50.640
<b>Huh? You let them go?</b>

06:51.140 --> 06:52.400
<b>I didn't.</b>

06:54.160 --> 06:56.250
<b>Hey, don't leave me!</b>

06:58.400 --> 07:02.440
<b>Wha—What is that monster?</b>

07:04.970 --> 07:08.870
<b>I never should've gotten
involved with them.</b>

07:13.330 --> 07:15.300
<b>Anyway, let's get away from here.</b>

07:15.300 --> 07:16.210
<b>Stop!</b>

07:17.880 --> 07:19.010
<b>We are the guards.</b>

07:19.380 --> 07:21.720
<b>We have some questions
about this situation.</b>

07:22.430 --> 07:26.990
<b>We got lost and found them
already like that.</b>

07:28.430 --> 07:29.710
<b>You're lying!</b>

07:29.710 --> 07:33.880
<b>We saw them fall suddenly
when they were about to attack you.</b>

07:33.880 --> 07:35.930
<b>You're making us the suspects?!</b>

07:35.930 --> 07:38.850
<b>If you were watching,
why didn't you help us?</b>

07:39.210 --> 07:43.230
<b>We were trying to root out their backing.</b>

07:43.570 --> 07:49.160
<b>In short, you wanted to track
who they wanted to sell us to?</b>

07:49.160 --> 07:51.210
<b>Precisely!</b>

07:51.210 --> 07:53.510
<b>Don't try anything weird.</b>

07:53.510 --> 07:57.040
<b>Guards like us have Sage Protection.</b>

07:57.040 --> 07:59.880
<b>Your Gifts do not affect us.</b>

08:00.160 --> 08:02.030
<b>Captain Edelgart.</b>

08:02.030 --> 08:06.340
<b>According to my Appraisal skill,
these two don't possess any Gifts.</b>

08:06.340 --> 08:07.720
<b>What?!</b>

08:07.720 --> 08:10.870
<b>It's difficult to conclude
that they did this.</b>

08:12.850 --> 08:14.680
<b>Fine! Let's go!</b>

08:15.140 --> 08:18.770
<b>I apologize for my captain's rudeness.</b>

08:19.090 --> 08:24.230
<b>No problem. Instead, can you
show us to a place to stay the night?</b>

08:25.570 --> 08:28.010
<b>Jorge, one of them is alive!</b>

08:32.910 --> 08:35.700
<b>What is this? This is amazing!</b>

08:35.700 --> 08:37.390
<b>It looks like a castle!</b>

08:37.390 --> 08:40.420
<b>Although I've never been inside
a castle before.</b>

08:40.420 --> 08:44.250
<b>So, about the room.
Want to share a room?</b>

08:45.120 --> 08:48.110
<b>I think that's a bit much.</b>

08:48.820 --> 08:52.270
<b>Then, let's have our rooms be
next to each other.</b>

08:59.690 --> 09:02.290
<b>So big!
Is this really for one person?</b>

09:05.150 --> 09:08.570
<b>What was he thinking about?
Sharing a room?</b>

09:10.030 --> 09:15.040
<b>Right, this is the first time I'm alone
without Takatou in this world.</b>

09:16.200 --> 09:20.140
<b>Does he really like me?</b>

09:20.450 --> 09:23.500
<b>But what he likes is...</b>

09:25.190 --> 09:27.480
<b>It's because your boobs are soft.</b>

09:30.350 --> 09:31.510
<b>Who's there?</b>

09:41.810 --> 09:43.330
<b>Big Sis?</b>

09:43.790 --> 09:45.900
<b>How did you get into this world?!</b>

09:45.900 --> 09:49.090
<b>Please don't associate me with her!</b>

09:49.680 --> 09:51.930
<b>I am Mokomoko Dannoura!</b>

09:51.930 --> 09:54.150
<b>The wife of the founder's son of
the Dannoura School,</b>

09:54.150 --> 09:57.510
<b>known as the restorer the school and
the guardian of the Dannoura family,</b>

09:57.510 --> 10:00.570
<b>your ancestor
and guardian spirit!</b>

10:02.080 --> 10:04.050
<b>Don't pack it all in at once!</b>

10:04.050 --> 10:06.040
<b>I can't make any comment!</b>

10:06.040 --> 10:07.910
<b>Guardian spirit?</b>

10:07.910 --> 10:11.760
<b>Since this situation is an emergency,
I have appeared to help you.</b>

10:11.760 --> 10:13.280
<b>Why now?!</b>

10:13.280 --> 10:16.220
<b>If you wanted to save me,
couldn't you do it earlier?</b>

10:16.220 --> 10:18.620
<b>I see that boy is truly dangerous.</b>

10:18.620 --> 10:23.390
<b>If I were to appear recklessly,
he might erase me.</b>

10:23.390 --> 10:28.400
<b>That means his ability even works
on spirits, huh?</b>

10:28.940 --> 10:35.860
<b>That's why tell him about me tomorrow
so that I can be safe!</b>

10:36.280 --> 10:37.730
<b>Sure.</b>

10:37.730 --> 10:40.420
<b>Did you say you want to help me?</b>

10:40.620 --> 10:43.790
<b>As you can see, I am a spiritual being.</b>

10:43.790 --> 10:46.100
<b>I can protect you from anything
but physical attacks.</b>

10:46.100 --> 10:51.090
<b>In fact, it was me who prevented
the installation of that Gift thingy.</b>

10:51.090 --> 10:53.220
<b>That was you?!</b>

10:53.220 --> 10:55.340
<b>Why did you do that?</b>

10:55.560 --> 10:58.660
<b>Did you want something suspicious
put in you?</b>

10:58.660 --> 10:59.600
<b>Huh?</b>

11:00.990 --> 11:02.620
<b>Of course, it has its advantages.</b>

11:02.620 --> 11:07.480
<b>But when you accept it,
that sage will take ahold your life.</b>

11:07.480 --> 11:10.440
<b>Does that mean it couldn't be
installed to others too</b>

11:10.440 --> 11:13.440
<b>because they were protected
by something like a spirit?</b>

11:13.440 --> 11:15.510
<b>I don't know about the others.</b>

11:15.510 --> 11:20.990
<b>Anyway, it's my wish to return the successor
to the Dannoura School of archery—</b>

11:20.990 --> 11:24.620
<b>a mixed martial art that has been
practiced since the Heian period</b>

11:24.620 --> 11:26.420
<b>—to the original world safely!</b>

11:26.740 --> 11:29.920
<b>I'd love to go home.</b>

11:29.920 --> 11:33.510
<b>But all I can do right now
is to rely on Takatou.</b>

11:33.510 --> 11:38.580
<b>As such, I shall personally teach you
the true art of the Dannoura School!</b>

11:38.580 --> 11:39.980
<b>I shall name it:</b>

11:39.840 --> 11:41.550
<b>My Guardian Spirit is the Strongest,
This Other World Doesn't Stand a Chance!</b>

11:39.980 --> 11:42.510
<b>"Operation: My Guardian Spirit is the Strongest,</b>

11:41.130 --> 11:48.220
<b>My Guardian Spirit is the Strongest,
This Other World Doesn't Stand a Chance!</b>

11:42.510 --> 11:45.470
<b>This Other World Doesn't Stand a Chance!"</b>

11:45.470 --> 11:47.710
<b>Are you really from the Heian period?!</b>

11:49.600 --> 11:52.210
<b>Good morning. You couldn't sleep?</b>

11:52.690 --> 11:56.090
<b>Well, yeah, after everything
that happened yesterday.</b>

11:56.310 --> 12:00.280
<b>So, are we going to catch up
with everyone after this?</b>

12:00.630 --> 12:02.180
<b>Well, about that...</b>

12:02.950 --> 12:08.170
<b>I am the concierge of this hotel.
My name is Celestina.</b>

12:08.170 --> 12:10.890
<b>Oh, nice to meet you.</b>

12:10.890 --> 12:13.100
<b>Since yesterday, Celestina has been</b>

12:13.100 --> 12:18.000
<b>looking up the location of
our classmates and how to get there,</b>

12:18.000 --> 12:22.370
<b>as well as preparing language translation
and status concealment items.</b>

12:22.370 --> 12:25.100
<b>She even made me a charger
for my handheld.</b>

12:26.100 --> 12:30.440
<b>These are your tickets to the Capital,
leaving today at noon.</b>

12:30.440 --> 12:31.840
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:31.840 --> 12:37.490
<b>Also, can you keep this for me?
I wonder if you can manage this.</b>

12:37.790 --> 12:42.700
<b>Takatou, I don't think you can ask
the concierge to do that much.</b>

12:43.010 --> 12:44.410
<b>Understood.</b>

12:44.410 --> 12:48.910
<b>This concierge is too competent,
there's nothing left for us to do!</b>

12:48.910 --> 12:53.920
<b>My Instant Death Ability is Overpowered</b>

12:53.920 --> 12:58.930
<b>My Instant Death Ability is Overpowered</b>

13:06.890 --> 13:13.520
<b>Why do I have to spin a charger
while buried in a ghost's stomach?</b>

13:14.710 --> 13:19.490
<b>I don't take up any physical space,
so no need to mind me.</b>

13:19.490 --> 13:21.840
<b>I don't mind it either.</b>

13:21.840 --> 13:24.700
<b>Then go to Takatou's seat!</b>

13:24.700 --> 13:27.790
<b>No way! He's scary.</b>

13:27.790 --> 13:29.560
<b>You should just disappear, then.</b>

13:29.560 --> 13:32.910
<b>It's not like I made myself visible.</b>

13:33.150 --> 13:36.670
<b>You're the one who started to notice me.</b>

13:37.290 --> 13:39.490
<b>You can see her too, right, Takatou?</b>

13:40.250 --> 13:42.660
<b>Ever since you told me
she was there, yeah.</b>

13:42.990 --> 13:46.390
<b>Anyway, you can sit here
next to me instead.</b>

13:46.390 --> 13:48.180
<b>Oh, that's an option too.</b>

13:50.010 --> 13:52.650
<b>Everyone is around here, right?</b>

13:52.650 --> 13:59.510
<b>Celestina thinks our classmates are
moving around Primeval Forest to train.</b>

13:59.860 --> 14:03.290
<b>How can she know that much?
Who is she exactly?</b>

14:09.110 --> 14:10.230
<b>What?!</b>

14:15.330 --> 14:18.160
<b>- Hey, there is this place?! Hey!
- As you can see,</b>

14:18.160 --> 14:20.840
<b>we haven't been able to question him.</b>

14:20.840 --> 14:26.050
<b>Boss! Mireiyu!
Are you there? Save me, please!</b>

14:26.410 --> 14:28.830
<b>- Hey! Can't you hear me?!
- We've already tried healing magic on him, but...</b>

14:29.140 --> 14:32.630
<b>There are no injuries visible.
Interesting.</b>

14:32.630 --> 14:33.650
<b>Lady Sage?</b>

14:37.110 --> 14:38.190
<b>Heal.</b>

14:42.250 --> 14:43.900
<b>Shit. I can't see anything.</b>

14:43.900 --> 14:47.900
<b>His sight still hasn't returned
despite gaining a new eye.</b>

14:47.900 --> 14:48.740
<b>Then...</b>

14:53.630 --> 14:54.690
<b>Lady Lain?!</b>

14:54.690 --> 14:56.880
<b>Sage Lain is a vampire.</b>

14:56.880 --> 15:00.840
<b>Her class is Origin Blood,
the highest rank of undead.</b>

15:01.170 --> 15:04.300
<b>When she inducts someone
into her bloodline,</b>

15:04.300 --> 15:07.760
<b>their physical abilities will
improve enormously.</b>

15:09.370 --> 15:12.260
<b>Inducting him into my bloodline
also doesn't work.</b>

15:12.260 --> 15:13.730
<b>This is really interesting.</b>

15:17.440 --> 15:19.190
<b>What's going on?</b>

15:19.190 --> 15:20.270
<b>It's him!</b>

15:22.920 --> 15:25.450
<b>My Appraisal says his class is brave.</b>

15:25.450 --> 15:26.680
<b>What?!</b>

15:27.290 --> 15:30.010
<b>Attention to all passengers.</b>

15:30.220 --> 15:34.370
<b>A sage is currently engaged
with an Aggressor nearby.</b>

15:34.830 --> 15:38.630
<b>I don't think they're after us.</b>

15:39.030 --> 15:41.300
<b>What's happening here?</b>

15:45.870 --> 15:47.300
<b>That's a robot!</b>

15:47.760 --> 15:49.590
<b>So that is the Aggressor.</b>

15:50.100 --> 15:51.740
<b>That means it's an invader.</b>

15:52.330 --> 15:53.790
<b>Where's the sage?</b>

15:54.020 --> 15:55.650
<b>That one, maybe?</b>

15:56.410 --> 15:58.170
<b>You can see that far?</b>

16:09.200 --> 16:11.240
<b>This is a problem.</b>

16:11.240 --> 16:14.490
<b>Hey, why not get rid of those guys?</b>

16:14.490 --> 16:15.910
<b>The reason for that being?</b>

16:16.640 --> 16:19.040
<b>Uh, because they're in our way?</b>

16:19.040 --> 16:22.080
<b>If that's the case,
wouldn't that mean</b>

16:22.080 --> 16:25.630
<b>I can kill people for walking
in front of me since they're in my way?</b>

16:25.630 --> 16:28.390
<b>But we could have died back then.</b>

16:28.390 --> 16:30.810
<b>It doesn't look like they're targeting us.</b>

16:31.430 --> 16:34.660
<b>You know, I have to set some rules.</b>

16:34.980 --> 16:39.140
<b>Otherwise, I'd end up
killing anyone that annoys me.</b>

16:40.120 --> 16:43.520
<b>Sorry, I guess I'm being naïve.</b>

16:43.520 --> 16:45.840
<b>I'm not blaming you,
so don't worry about it.</b>

16:52.730 --> 16:54.180
<b>It's the Aggresor!</b>

16:56.920 --> 16:59.460
<b>Bastard! Stop running!</b>

17:10.250 --> 17:13.260
<b>I like this dress, though.</b>

17:13.260 --> 17:16.250
<b>She took all of those attacks
and unharmed?!</b>

17:16.250 --> 17:20.770
<b>To be precise, no matter how much damage
she takes, she can heal instantly.</b>

17:20.770 --> 17:22.230
<b>You monster!</b>

17:23.060 --> 17:26.650
<b>Why are you attacking a sage?</b>

17:26.650 --> 17:29.820
<b>The brave should be defeating
the Demon Lord.</b>

17:29.820 --> 17:30.840
<b>Shut up!</b>

17:30.840 --> 17:33.410
<b>I can't forgive your tyranny!</b>

17:33.410 --> 17:36.100
<b>I'll eradicate all sages from this world!</b>

17:38.210 --> 17:41.120
<b>O Holy Sword Cartena!</b>

17:50.330 --> 17:53.940
<b>Ariel, I finally defeated one.</b>

17:59.530 --> 18:01.230
<b>So cruel.</b>

18:01.400 --> 18:02.330
<b>What?</b>

18:02.950 --> 18:04.880
<b>Why did you attack us?</b>

18:05.400 --> 18:07.250
<b>We have nothing to do with your fight.</b>

18:07.650 --> 18:08.710
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:13.310
<b>If you see a sage, it's your duty to kneel
down on the ground and give praise!</b>

18:13.310 --> 18:15.620
<b>You are eyesores!</b>

18:15.620 --> 18:18.390
<b>The only eyesore here is you.</b>

18:23.410 --> 18:25.140
<b>You killed him?</b>

18:25.140 --> 18:28.180
<b>Yup, that was enough reason to kill him.</b>

18:29.890 --> 18:32.720
<b>Wait, I have no intention of fighting you.</b>

18:34.320 --> 18:37.720
<b>Is Ariel the name of your lover?</b>

18:38.580 --> 18:41.020
<b>How did you avoid that?</b>

18:41.330 --> 18:43.210
<b>I didn't.</b>

18:43.580 --> 18:47.250
<b>I can't die anyway.
Moving is just a hassle.</b>

18:47.250 --> 18:48.340
<b>That's absurd!</b>

18:48.880 --> 18:51.170
<b>You should've died without
leaving a trace.</b>

18:51.190 --> 18:54.550
<b>If I could die from an attack like that,
things would be a lot easier for me.</b>

18:55.710 --> 18:56.700
<b>Kill me.</b>

18:57.620 --> 18:59.340
<b>I don't even feel like killing you.</b>

19:04.010 --> 19:06.330
<b>Track Yogiri Takatou's whereabouts.</b>

19:06.330 --> 19:07.460
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

19:07.950 --> 19:09.480
<b>I would like to negotiate.</b>

19:09.940 --> 19:13.070
<b>If you want something I can provide,
I will give it to you.</b>

19:13.070 --> 19:16.920
<b>This robot is
wary of your ability, Takatou.</b>

19:16.920 --> 19:20.390
<b>Can you tell us
how to get back to our world?</b>

19:20.820 --> 19:24.230
<b>What I know is the way to return
to the world I came from.</b>

19:24.750 --> 19:27.960
<b>Is it possible to bring us there?</b>

19:28.530 --> 19:29.660
<b>That is not possible.</b>

19:29.660 --> 19:34.680
<b>My entire being is not present here.</b>

19:34.680 --> 19:40.550
<b>And I can't bring someone as
dangerous as you to my world.</b>

19:40.550 --> 19:43.210
<b>This world exists on the lowest level.</b>

19:43.210 --> 19:49.130
<b>Climbing up requires coordinates
and an enormous amount of energy.</b>

19:49.460 --> 19:55.290
<b>Then, I'm fine concluding our negotiation
if you can give us advice to find those two.</b>

19:55.290 --> 19:56.550
<b>I understand.</b>

19:57.280 --> 20:00.320
<b>Do you need anything, Dannoura?</b>

20:00.320 --> 20:02.750
<b>Even if you say that...</b>

20:02.750 --> 20:06.610
<b>In that case, I have a suggestion!</b>

20:09.030 --> 20:09.880
<b>Wha...</b>

20:10.270 --> 20:13.200
<b>He's Sage Santarou, right?</b>

20:14.530 --> 20:18.610
<b>Yogiri Takatou and Tomochika Dannoura?</b>

20:18.610 --> 20:22.430
<b>I find it hard to believe that
they can defeat a sage.</b>

20:22.930 --> 20:25.930
<b>I heard they use a really weird ability.</b>

20:26.410 --> 20:28.410
<b>Instant Death magic, was it?</b>

20:28.690 --> 20:32.940
<b>But Santarou has Instant Death resistance.</b>

20:33.550 --> 20:35.630
<b>I see, Instant Death.</b>

20:36.300 --> 20:40.070
<b>I thought you were going to ask me
about the Darkness.</b>

20:40.640 --> 20:43.210
<b>Driving out the Aggressors is important,</b>

20:43.210 --> 20:46.020
<b>but we shouldn't take those
who can kill sages lightly.</b>

20:46.500 --> 20:50.270
<b>I would like to ask you not to
lay a hand to sage candidates.</b>

20:50.580 --> 20:54.360
<b>But I'll allow it if you're willing to
drive out the Darkness.</b>

20:54.360 --> 20:55.300
<b>Fine.</b>

20:55.630 --> 20:56.700
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:58.690 --> 21:00.030
<b>Masayuki.</b>

21:00.500 --> 21:01.640
<b>You called?</b>

21:01.840 --> 21:04.910
<b>Lead the Immortal Army to Hanabusa.</b>

21:05.140 --> 21:06.100
<b>What?</b>

21:06.410 --> 21:09.920
<b>Regular troops might not stand a chance.</b>

21:10.370 --> 21:12.350
<b>Hey, hey, hey...</b>

21:12.640 --> 21:16.300
<b>So you mean, it doesn't matter if
Hanabusa is destroyed?</b>

21:21.590 --> 21:23.320
<b>Let's rest a bit.</b>

21:23.610 --> 21:26.970
<b>I told you we should have had
the robot to carry us here.</b>

21:27.310 --> 21:31.940
<b>If anyone sees us with the Aggressor,
it would cause trouble for us.</b>

21:32.250 --> 21:35.100
<b>I guess so. They're invaders, after all.</b>

21:35.540 --> 21:38.630
<b>We could have asked for a vehicle.</b>

21:38.630 --> 21:39.650
<b>I'm here!</b>

21:40.230 --> 21:43.360
<b>I got something really nice.</b>

21:44.510 --> 21:45.830
<b>What is this?</b>

21:45.830 --> 21:50.450
<b>It was made of that robot's parts,
and it can transform at will.</b>

21:50.450 --> 21:52.290
<b>Where did this come from?</b>

21:52.290 --> 21:56.130
<b>It's disguised as a part of your garment.</b>

21:57.420 --> 22:03.630
<b>Wait, you think I'd be able to use
a sci-fi-like weapon just like that?!</b>

22:20.610 --> 22:24.820
<b>The scales swaying in the wind,
the second hand announces chaos</b>

22:24.820 --> 22:28.330
<b>Our truths have lost their meaning easily</b>

22:28.330 --> 22:32.580
<b>It's a comedy that exceeds karma,
darker than despair</b>

22:32.580 --> 22:35.960
<b>My tongue is dry of trivial preamble</b>

22:35.960 --> 22:40.760
<b>At the end of a ridiculous dream,</b>

22:40.760 --> 22:43.840
<b>the Arcadia was trampled down</b>

22:43.840 --> 22:50.520
<b>Still, it's a hazy madness
until you touch it</b>

22:50.520 --> 22:51.720
<b>"Lost in the Haze"</b>

22:51.720 --> 22:55.440
<b>Beyond this point,
neither prayer nor resolve will work</b>

22:55.440 --> 22:59.230
<b>Are you ready to look into the abyss?</b>

22:59.230 --> 23:05.030
<b>The bottom of a stomach that easily
swallows ridiculous contradictions</b>

23:05.030 --> 23:10.740
<b>No one will be able to escape the end</b>

23:35.470 --> 23:40.100
<b>The World Isn't So Soft That It Will Let You Act without Consequences</b>

23:36.210 --> 23:39.980
<b>"The World Isn't So Soft That
It Will Let You Act without Consequences".</b>
